+# SPEC: `YEAR` placeholder in `hack/boilerplate.go.txt`
+
+Status: implemented
+
+## Objective
+Stop scaffolded copyright headers from going stale. `kubebuilder init` writes a
+`YEAR` placeholder into `hack/boilerplate.go.txt`; kubebuilder and controller-gen
+resolve it to the current year when generating files (same convention as gengo
+and controller-gen's `year=` option, controller-tools#544).
+
+Users: Kubebuilder project authors (go/v4 and plugins that build on it, e.g.
+deploy-image).
+
+## Acceptance criteria
+1. `kubebuilder init` (license != none) writes `Copyright YEAR <owner>.` / `Copyright YEAR.`
+   into `hack/boilerplate.go.txt`.
+2. Any boilerplate passed to `machinery.WithBoilerplate` has every `YEAR`
+   replaced with the current year (`time.Now().Year()`), so all Go files scaffolded
+   by `init`, `create api`, `create webhook` and plugins (deploy-image) get a resolved
+   year. Boilerplates without `YEAR` are unchanged (backwards compatible).
+3. The scaffolded Makefile declares `YEAR ?= $(shell date +%Y)` and the `generate`
+   target runs
+   `"$(CONTROLLER_GEN)" object:headerFile="hack/boilerplate.go.txt",year=$(YEAR) paths="./..."`.
+   With no boilerplate (`--license none`) it stays `object paths="./..."`.
+4. Users can override with `make generate YEAR=2024`.
+
+## Commands
+- Unit tests: `go test ./pkg/...`
+- Lint: `make lint` (golangci-lint)
+- Regenerate samples: `make generate` (testdata + docs tutorials)
+
+## Project structure (touched)
+- `pkg/machinery/scaffold.go` – `WithBoilerplate` performs substitution.
+- `pkg/plugins/golang/v4/scaffolds/internal/templates/hack/boilerplate.go` – default `Year` = `YEAR`.
+- `pkg/plugins/golang/v4/scaffolds/internal/templates/makefile.go` – `YEAR` var and `year=` arg.
+- `testdata/**`, `docs/book/src/**/testdata/**` – regenerated samples.
+
+## Code style
+Follow existing Go style in `pkg/machinery`; exported constant for the placeholder,
+doc comments on exported identifiers, keep `//nolint:lll` on templates.
+
+## Testing strategy
+- Unit test in `pkg/machinery` (Ginkgo): `WithBoilerplate` replaces `YEAR`, leaves
+  other text untouched.
+- Unit test for `hack.Boilerplate` default year being `YEAR`.
+- Sample projects updated so e2e/sample diffs match.
+
+## Boundaries
+- Always: keep explicit `Year` overrides on `hack.Boilerplate` working.
+- Never: rewrite users' existing `boilerplate.go.txt` files on disk.
+- Out of scope: migrating existing projects' Makefiles (handled by alpha generate / upgrade flows).
